# Run requests from Rider: start the API ("http" profile), then click the ▶ next to a request.
# Requests are separated by ###. Variables are declared with @name = value.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5123

### Flights within 30 km of Dublin Airport
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights?lat=53.4213&lon=-6.2701&radiusKm=30
Accept: application/json

### Flights within 50 km of London Heathrow
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights?lat=51.4700&lon=-0.4543&radiusKm=50
Accept: application/json

### Validation error: latitude out of range and radius missing → 400 ProblemDetails
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights?lat=95&lon=0
Accept: application/json

### Unparseable value → 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flights?lat=abc&lon=0&radiusKm=50
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document (Development only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Liveness: the process answers (no dependency checks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

### Readiness: JSON with each check (Redis shows Degraded if it isn't running)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready
